[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:A Cold Welcome]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.41]What does 'a cold welcome' refer to? | “冷遇”指的是什么？
[00:15.22]On Wednesday evening, we went to the Town Hall. | 星期三的晚上，我们去了市政厅。
[00:19.29]It was the last day of the year | 那是一年的最后一天，
[00:21.86]and a large crowd of people had gathered under the Town Hall clock. | 一大群人聚集在市政厅的大钟下面。
[00:27.32]It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time. | 再过20分钟，大钟将敲响12下。
[00:31.52]Fifteen minutes passed and then, | 15分钟过去了，
[00:34.22]at five to twelve, the clock stopped. | 11点55分时，大钟停了。
[00:37.85]The big minute hand did not move. | 那根巨大的分针不动了。
[00:40.74]We waited and waited, | 我们等啊等啊，
[00:43.35]but nothing happened. | 可情况没有变化。
[00:45.14]Suddenly someone shouted. | 突然有人喊道：
[00:47.69]'It's two minutes past twelve! | “已经12点零2分了！
[00:50.72]The clock has stopped!' | 大钟停了！”
[00:53.03]I looked at my watch. | 我看了看我的手表。
[00:54.70]It was true. | 果真如此。
[00:56.43]The big clock refused to welcome the New Year. | 那座大钟不愿意迎接新年。
[01:00.66]At that moment, everybody began to laugh and sing. | 此时，大家已经笑了起来，同时唱起了歌。
